Third-party acknowledgements
============================

Harbor
------

Parts of the LexVerse runtime architecture were independently implemented
with reference to design patterns used by Harbor:

    Harbor — https://github.com/harbor-framework/harbor
    Copyright (c) Harbor contributors
    Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0
    Reference commit: 71c77fdd119df12eb6ab56e5bc0f29bf62fad338

LexVerse does not vendor Harbor code directly; the LexVerse runtime is a
minimal, purpose-built re-implementation that adopts Harbor's high-level
patterns (bounded async concurrency, per-trial working directories,
SIGTERM→SIGKILL timeout escalation, checkpoint-based resume). If Harbor
source code is copied or adapted in the future, the applicable Apache-2.0
notices and attribution must be preserved.

